Version: 1.0
ProjectId: 8ea8f592-9071-4b60-b95a-0bd1f996640c

RestoreWorkspace: No
SaveWorkspace: No
AlwaysSaveHistory: No

EnableCodeIndexing: Yes
UseSpacesForTab: Yes
NumSpacesForTab: 2
Encoding: UTF-8

RnwWeave: knitr
LaTeX: pdfLaTeX

AutoAppendNewline: Yes
StripTrailingWhitespace: Yes

BuildType: Package
PackageInstallArgs: --no-multiarch --with-keep.source
PackageCheckArgs: --no-install
PackageRoxygenize: rd,collate,namespace,vignette
